Community Standards
Virtual World Platform
Version: 1.0
Applies To: All Users, Creators, Communities, Marketplace Participants and Staff
Last Updated: November 2026

Welcome
Virtual World Platform is a place to create, socialise, explore, build communities, and express creativity.

These Community Standards exist to help ensure that all users can enjoy a safe, respectful, and welcoming experience.

By participating in the platform, you agree to follow these standards.

Failure to follow these standards may result in warnings, content removal, temporary restrictions, suspension, or permanent account termination.

Our Community Values
Every member of the platform is expected to uphold the following principles:

Respect
Treat other users with dignity and respect.

Responsibility
You are responsible for your behaviour, content, and interactions.

Safety
Help maintain a safe environment for yourself and others.

Creativity
Create and share content in ways that enrich the community.

Integrity
Act honestly and avoid behaviour that harms users or undermines trust.

Be Respectful
You may not:

Harass other users
Bully other users
Intimidate other users
Deliberately provoke or target individuals
Encourage others to harass another user
Repeatedly contact users who have asked to be left alone
Examples include:

Threats
Targeted insults
Repeated unwanted messages
Coordinated harassment
Stalking behaviour
Hate and Discrimination
We do not allow content or behaviour that attacks, promotes hatred toward, or encourages discrimination against people based on characteristics such as:

Race
Ethnicity
Nationality
Religion
Gender
Gender identity
Sexual orientation
Disability
Age
Users are free to express opinions and engage in respectful discussion, but attacks directed at people because of protected characteristics are prohibited.

Child Safety
Protecting minors is a core platform priority.

The following are strictly prohibited:

Grooming behaviour
Sexual communication with minors
Attempting to establish inappropriate relationships with minors
Sharing sexual content involving minors
Exploiting minors
Soliciting personal information from minors for inappropriate purposes
Any behaviour that may endanger a minor may result in immediate account suspension while an investigation occurs.

Harassment and Abuse
The following behaviour is prohibited:

Personal attacks
Threats
Blackmail
Extortion
Doxxing
Stalking
Repeated unwanted contact
False impersonation
Encouraging self-harm
Malicious reporting
Users should be able to enjoy the platform without fear of abuse.

Privacy and Personal Information
Respect the privacy of others.

Do not share:

Phone numbers
Home addresses
Government identification information
Financial information
Private messages without permission
Personal information belonging to another user
Users should only share personal information at their own discretion and risk.

Impersonation
You may not impersonate:

Other users
Staff members
Moderators
Businesses
Public figures
Government agencies
Parody and roleplay are permitted when clearly identifiable and not intended to deceive others.

Fraud and Scams
The following are prohibited:

Financial scams
Marketplace fraud
Chargeback abuse
Account theft
Phishing
Fake giveaways
False advertising
Manipulative schemes
Users must represent transactions honestly.

Appropriate Communication
Communication should remain respectful and appropriate for the applicable environment.

Users may not:

Spam
Flood chats
Disrupt conversations
Use communications to harass others
Circumvent moderation systems
Adult Environment Standards
Verified adult users may access expanded social and creative features.

However, users remain subject to:

Anti-harassment rules
Anti-fraud rules
Privacy standards
Community safety requirements
Adult status does not exempt users from platform rules.

Teen Environment Standards
Users in the Teen Environment must follow all platform rules.

Additional restrictions may apply to:

Communication
Content sharing
Marketplace participation
Profile information
These additional safeguards exist to promote age-appropriate experiences and user safety.

User Generated Content
Creators are responsible for the content they create and publish.

Content must not include:

Harassment
Hate content
Illegal content
Fraudulent content
Malicious software
Exploitative content
Copyright infringement
All user-generated content is subject to moderation review.

Virtual Homes and Communities
Users are responsible for activity occurring within spaces they manage.

Property owners and community leaders should:

Maintain a welcoming environment
Follow Community Standards
Address disruptive behaviour appropriately
Repeated violations may result in restrictions on properties or communities.

Marketplace Standards
Marketplace participants must:

Accurately represent products
Deliver promised items
Respect intellectual property rights
Comply with creator policies
The following are prohibited:

Stolen content
Fraudulent listings
Misleading advertisements
Attempts to exploit platform systems
Exploits and Platform Abuse
Users may not:

Use cheats
Exploit bugs
Use unauthorised automation
Circumvent security systems
Attack platform infrastructure
Attempt unauthorised access to accounts
Security vulnerabilities should be reported responsibly.

Reporting Problems
Users are encouraged to report:

Harassment
Threats
Fraud
Inappropriate content
Child safety concerns
Exploit abuse
Submitting knowingly false reports may itself violate Community Standards.

Moderation
The platform uses:

User reports
Automated safety systems
Human moderation
Trust and Safety investigations
Moderation actions may include:

Warning
Content Removal
Temporary Restriction
Temporary Suspension
Permanent Suspension
Account Termination
The severity of enforcement depends on the nature of the violation.

Appeals
Users may appeal moderation actions.

Appeals are reviewed by moderators and Trust & Safety personnel.

The filing of an appeal does not guarantee reversal of an enforcement action.

One Account, One Reputation
Your reputation follows your account.

Actions taken within the platform contribute to your standing within the community.

Positive participation helps create a stronger and more enjoyable world for everyone.

Final Principle
The purpose of these Community Standards is not to control every interaction.

The goal is to create an environment where people can safely:

Socialise
Create
Build communities
Express themselves
Grow with the platform over time
Treat others with respect, use common sense, and contribute positively to the world we are building together.
